msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v3.7.0 and v3.8.0. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Voor gebruikers zichtbare API-breuken tussen v3.7.0 en v3.8.0. Bereik: "
